  m_Name: Desert_Cabin_6
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Game.Collectable.CollectableItem
  id: Desert_Cabin_6
  headerName: "House Notes \u2014 6"
  content: "Fried Locusts, Desert Style [Recipe]\n\r\n1. Preparation: Rinse the locusts
    clean. Traditional Bedouin practice involves a brief blanching to sanitize. Remove
    the wings and spiny leg sections \u2014 keep the rear legs if you enjoy the crunch.)\n\r\n2.
    Seasoning: Sea salt, black pepper, turmeric \u2014 for color and to neutralize
    any gamey odor. Vegetable oil or clarified butter (ghee) for frying.\n\r\n3.
    Method: Dry-roast in an empty pan over low heat until they begin to dry and turn
    reddish-brown. Add oil, increase heat slightly, fry until crisp and golden. Toss
    with spices. Drain. Rest briefly. Crisp when cooled.\r\n"
  type: 0
  biome: 1
